{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38174","headline":"余作探使以缭绫手帛子寄贺因而有诗 · 韩偓","name":"余作探使以缭绫手帛子寄贺因而有诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"解寄缭绫小字封，探花筵上映春丛。\n黛眉印在微微绿，檀口消来薄薄红。\n缏处直应心共紧，砑时兼恐汗先融。\n帝台春尽还东去，却系帬腰伴雪胷。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩偓","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38174.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38174","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}